ith automated backups.  ---       6.  Other Requirements          6. 1 Legal   - Compliance with data privacy laws (GDPR, CCPA). 2 Glossary   -   Predictive Analytics  : Forecasting future trends using historical data.  -   RBAC  : Role-Based Access Control.  ---   Approval   Prepared by:  Your Name  Reviewed by:  Lab Instructor s Name  Date:  DD MM YYYY  --- This SRS document provides a structured blueprint for developing the AI-Powered Talent Bridge platform, aligning with the hackathon s objectives and ensuring scalability, security, and sustainability"},"headers":{"Content-Type":"application/json","User-Agent":"@huggingface/inference/4.9.0 Node.js/22"},"method":"POST","url":"https://router.huggingface.co/hf-inference/models/sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2/pipeline/feature-extraction"},"httpResponse":{"body":"","requestId":"","status":401},"level":"error","message":"Failed to store vector for 1Q7QDyZkpDd9Qa-NJ3NCZX2Gdg_XAkZWL4_7qjSiLmsM: Failed to perform inference: an HTTP error occurred when requesting the provider","name":"ProviderApiError","service":"team-memory-backend","stack":"ProviderApiError: Failed to perform inference: an HTTP error occurred when requesting the provider\n    at innerRequest (D:\\Charaha\\backend\\node_modules\\@huggingface\\inference\\dist\\commonjs\\utils\\request.js:66:15)\n    at process.processTicksAndRejections (node:internal/process/task_queues:105:5)\n    at async featureExtraction (D:\\Charaha\\backend\\node_modules\\@huggingface\\inference\\dist\\commonjs\\tasks\\nlp\\featureExtraction.js:13:27)\n    at async VectorService.generateEmbedding (D:\\Charaha\\backend\\src\\services\\vector.service.js:45:24)\n    at async VectorService.storeVector (D:\\Charaha\\backend\\src\\services\\vector.service.js:59:25)\n    at async ingestFiles (D:\\Charaha\\backend\\src\\controllers\\google-drive.controller.js:103:11)","timestamp":"2025-09-29T07:30:09.379Z"}
